subject = "Freight Quotation – Hamburg to Shanghai – Ref#Q-5682"
body = "Dear [Customer Name],

Thank you for your inquiry regarding the freight service from Hamburg to Shanghai. Please find below our offer based on the provided shipment details (FCL, 20ft container, general cargo):

Freight Quote:

    Ocean Freight: €1,250.00

    Bunker Adjustment Factor (BAF): Included

    Port Charges (Origin): €120.00

    Port Charges (Destination): Not included

    Transit Time: Approx. 28 days

    Validity: 7 days (until June 24, 2025)

Let us know if you'd like us to proceed with booking or if you need a revised quote for different terms.

Looking forward to working with you.

Best regards,
[Your Name]
Sales Executive – Freight Solutions
[Your Company]
📞 +49 987 654 321 | ✉️ sales@[company].com"
